{"id": "swebq0237", "pool": "swebq", "tier": "conservative", "audio_s": 1.81, "n_chunks": 2, "n_concurrent": 2, "gen_active_at_eot": true, "eot_score": 0.1639, "eot_read_ms": 19, "reference_answer": "East Slavs;Europeans", "query": "where did russians originate?", "transcript": "Where did Russians originate?", "mode": "local", "answer": "The exact origins of the Russian people are complex and debated by historians, but most scholars agree that the ancestors of modern Russians came from a mix of indigenous East Slavic tribes and various migrations over centuries. The early Slavic peoples lived in Eastern Europe, and through interactions with Vikings, Mongols, and other groups, their culture and language evolved into what we now recognize as Russian. So while they didn't come from a single place, their roots are deeply woven into the history of Eastern Europe.", "answer_ms": 1983}
{"id": "swebq0240", "pool": "swebq", "tier": "conservative", "audio_s": 2.14, "n_chunks": 3, "n_concurrent": 3, "gen_active_at_eot": true, "eot_score": 0.2142, "eot_read_ms": 17, "reference_answer": "Đắk Nông Province", "query": "where to go in vietnam beaches?", "transcript": "Where to go in Vietnam beaches?", "mode": "local", "answer": "Vietnam has so many amazing beach destinations! If you're looking for stunning coastlines, Da Nang's My Khe Beach is often called Vietnam's best white sand beach. Nha Trang offers vibrant nightlife and clear waters perfect for diving. For something more secluded, check out the islands of Phu Quoc or Con Dao. If you want to mix beaches with culture, Hoi An's nearby coastlines are beautiful too. Each spot has its own charm—whether you want lively action or peaceful relaxation!", "answer_ms": 2098}
